ialog:** api_key (QLineEdit password mode), base_url, skill_dir, packs_dir, jobs spin, quality combo, models. Save → config.json.\n\n**Workers:** generic:\n\n```python\nclass Worker(QThread):\n    progress = Signal(str, str, str)  # item, kind, message\n    done = Signal(object)  # result payload\n    failed = Signal(str)\n    def __init__(self, fn, *args, **kwargs): ...\n    def run(self):\n        try:\n            self.done.emit(self.fn(*self.args, **self.kwargs))\n        except SystemExit as e:\n            self.failed.emit(str(e))\n        except Exception as e:\n            self.failed.emit(str(e))\n```\n\ngen worker needs progress_cb bridging: pass lambda that emits self.progress. Careful: emitting signals from worker thread is fine (queued).\n\nenv patching: core.env_patch contextmanager sets os.environ[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]=cfg api_key etc. Must apply around op calls inside worker.\n\n**Drag & drop:** Step1 photo drop widget: subclass QLabel with dragEnterEvent/dropEvent accepting image urls. setAcceptDrops(True).\n\n**Fonts/appearance:** default Fusion style; window title \"表情包工坊\"; min size ~1000x700.\n\nEdge cases:\n- No project yet → step buttons besides step1 disabled-ish; or auto-create project on demand. Flow: [新建项目] prompts name → creates packs/<name>/ dir; [打开项目] → QFileDialog.getExistingDirectory. Keep `current_pack` None until then; guard actions with message.\n- Opening existing project: load pack.json into step2 widgets, show character, etc.\n\nCost estimation dry-run without calling API: replicate:\n\n```python\ndef dry_run_count(sticker, pack_dir, with_assets=True):\n    p, pack = sticker.load_pack(pack_dir)\n    jobs = sticker._jobs(p, pack, model, quality, with_assets, None)\n    todo = [j for j in jobs if not j[0].exists()]\n    return len(todo), len(todo) * 0.052\n```\nUses sticker._jobs — no API call, just fs checks. \n\nNote: `sticker._jobs` calls sys.exit if character missing → catch SystemExit → show \"先生成角色图\".\n\nAlso gen prints \"要生